      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.62,
      "end_seconds": 40.89,
      "duration_seconds": 11.27,
      "text": "about a five out of ten. Oh, you know, and a runny nose. That's been about the same, three weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.98,
      "end_seconds": 46.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "has there been a mild temperature too?"
