      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.83,
      "end_seconds": 124.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "The spots fade when pressed and he is playful and drinking well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.77,
      "end_seconds": 133.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Have you noticed breathlessness, drowsiness or stiff neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.35,
      "end_seconds": 138.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Nope, uh, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.82,
      "end_seconds": 142.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.62,
      "end_seconds": 148.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.2,
      "end_seconds": 153.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.7,
      "end_seconds": 157.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "no weakness or anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.76,
      "end_seconds": 163.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.24,
      "end_seconds": 169.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "um um my grandfather had a stroke"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.69,
      "end_seconds": 184.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.08,
      "end_seconds": 199.28,
      "duration_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.98,
      "end_seconds": 204.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.97,
      "end_seconds": 221.23,
      "duration_seconds": 15.26,
      "text": "I have arthritis in my knees, for about ten years. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.57,
      "end_seconds": 232.89,
      "duration_seconds": 10.32,
      "text": "Right, so arthritis in your knees is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.42,
      "end_seconds": 242.37,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "yes you know I had a caesarean for my second baby nine years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.34,
      "end_seconds": 248.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.46,
      "end_seconds": 258.1,
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "text": "Yes, plasters. I've no idea what the reaction was, only that I'm not supposed to have it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.12,
      "end_seconds": 261.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Right tell me your medicines please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.71,
      "end_seconds": 268.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "Naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day for the knee pain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.05,
      "end_seconds": 294.77,
      "duration_seconds": 10.72,
      "text": "let me tell you where I've got to this is probably a harmless viral rash an allergic rash is also on my list"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.25,
      "end_seconds": 312.31,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "Fluids and paracetamol if he is hot or uncomfortable. I'd like to see you again if it lasts more than a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.93,
      "end_seconds": 314.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.33,
      "end_seconds": 318.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.47,
      "end_seconds": 329.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "so, uh, I come back if it lasts more than a week is that right?"
    },
